<title>ISRAEL: Israeli woman injured in possible West Bank attack.</title>
<headline>Israeli woman injured in possible West Bank attack.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Israeli woman was injured in the West Bank on Sunday in what Israeli security sources said was an apparent Palestinian attack.</p>
<p>The sources said the woman's car overturned near the Arab village of Sourif near Hebron after it was apparently either shot at or stoned. &quot;It was an attack,&quot; one source said.</p>
</text>
